words # a comment after a concept
  dog # another one
  cat: count=3, code=007, neg=-5, f=1.5

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["concept", "words"],
	["comment", "# a comment after a concept"],

	["concept", "dog"],
	["comment", "# another one"],

	["concept", "cat"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["attr-name", "count"],
	["operator", "="],
	["number", "3"],
	["punctuation", ","],
	["attr-name", "code"],
	["operator", "="],
	["number", "007"],
	["punctuation", ","],
	["attr-name", "neg"],
	["operator", "="],
	["attr-value", "-5"],
	["punctuation", ","],
	["attr-name", "f"],
	["operator", "="],
	["attr-value", "1.5"]
]

----------------------------------------------------

A # ends a concept name. Only all-digit values are numbers; -5 and 1.5 are
strings to the reader.
